                                "sense_id": "ecc5afc9-0dcc-3577-810d-7d66337d3f51",
                                "text": "A chance to find out who they are, and thusly, who I am"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1155f026-debe-4ab9-87b2-e43b8e2ab9c8",
                                "sense_id": "ecc5afc9-0dcc-3577-810d-7d66337d3f51",
                                "text": "Thusly, most larger criminal cases in Great Britain are handled by freelance inspectors."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c3afda13-a2ae-34f2-ab27-c1e88e577549",
